  "body_html": "<h1>self_mem_paretoDomSet</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\nlemma self_mem_paretoDomSet [Fintype N] [Fintype G] (v : Valuation N G) (A : Allocation N G) : A ∈ Finset.univ.filter (fun B : N → Finset G =&gt; ∀ i : N, v.val i (A i) ≤ v.val i (B i))</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Valuation</li>\n<li>Allocation</li>\n</ul>",
